# Teal-orange grading LUT, 33^3, red-fastest (Adobe .cube 1.0).
# Deterministic fixture for parseCubeLut (PRD-03 Phase 2). Regenerate with:
#   id = (r,g,b)/32; L = max(id); w = (1-L)^2; h = 4*L*(1-L)
#   out = clamp01(id*(1-w) + teal*w + orange*h*(1-w)), teal=(0.10,0.25,0.55), orange=(0.06,0.01,-0.07)
# so LUT(0,0,0) = teal shadow and LUT(1,1,1) = (1,1,1).
TITLE "teal-orange-33"
LUT_3D_SIZE 33
DOMAIN_MIN 0 0 0
DOMAIN_MAX 1 1 1
